      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 5.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I think it's my turn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.7,
      "end_seconds": 10.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.36,
      "end_seconds": 14.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I've been losing weight without trying."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.56,
      "end_seconds": 28.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.96,
      "end_seconds": 35.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Around four weeks... no wait, it's more like three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.74,
      "end_seconds": 42.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. So, a few quick ones: difficulty swallowing or bone pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.48,
      "end_seconds": 47.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "No difficulty swallowing or bone pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.72,
      "end_seconds": 54.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "So, did you get blood in the stool or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.31,
      "end_seconds": 57.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.3,
      "end_seconds": 61.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.84,
      "end_seconds": 65.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.66,
      "end_seconds": 86.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.51,
      "end_seconds": 90.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.38,
      "end_seconds": 93.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.41,
      "end_seconds": 95.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.5,
      "end_seconds": 98.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.51,
      "end_seconds": 103.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.82,
      "end_seconds": 107.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.3,
      "end_seconds": 112.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.33,
      "end_seconds": 116.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Alright, do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.5,
      "end_seconds": 120.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.9,
      "end_seconds": 125.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.17,
      "end_seconds": 132.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.52,
      "end_seconds": 136.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.15,
      "end_seconds": 142.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "No, you know, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.46,
      "end_seconds": 164.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.81,
      "end_seconds": 168.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.42,
      "end_seconds": 174.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.09,
      "end_seconds": 177.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.71,
      "end_seconds": 184.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.01,
      "end_seconds": 188.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.3,
      "end_seconds": 207.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and I can't feel any lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.6,
      "end_seconds": 211.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.77,
      "end_seconds": 216.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Okay, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.77,
      "end_seconds": 239.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.02,
      "end_seconds": 244.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.43,
      "end_seconds": 278.12,
      "duration_seconds": 23.69,
      "text": "We should do a thyroid test for weight loss. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. I think the chest clinic should see you too. I'd like you back after the results are back. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.98,
      "end_seconds": 285.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.56,
      "end_seconds": 292.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Okay, yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.62,
      "end_seconds": 296.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.46,
      "end_seconds": 302.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
